    "created": "20260924184744924",
    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>6级 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 类人生物，人类</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 69；''重伤'' 34</span><span>''先攻'' +8</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 20，''强韧'' 18，''反射'' 18，''意志'' 17</span><span>''侦查'' +3</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">死亡狂怒</div>\n<div class=description>在重伤状态下，深渊掠夺者可以以一个标准动作进行两次长矛攻击，这两次攻击的攻击骰皆<br>受到-2 减值。深渊掠夺者在重伤状态下不能进行飞斧攻击和咆哮冲锋攻击。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}长矛（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：触及 2，+11 vs. AC<br>命中：1d8+6 伤害，且该深渊掠夺者快步一格。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/range}}飞斧（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：射程 5/10，+11 vs. AC<br>命中：1d6+6 伤害，且该深渊掠夺者快步一格。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">咆哮冲锋✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>该深渊掠夺者进行一次飞斧攻击然后对该攻击的目标进行冲锋。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 杂技+11，运动+11</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 16（+6）</span><span>''敏捷'' 16（+6）</span><span>''感知'' 11（+3）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 13（+4）</span><span>''智力'' 9（+2）</span><span>''魅力'' 10（+3）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 混乱邪恶</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 皮甲，长矛，2 把飞斧</span></div></div>\n</div>",
